{"evidence":[{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Stacey McClean (born 17 February 1989) is an English solo singer.","title":"Stacey McClean"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" She was part of the S Club spin-off band, S Club 8 and in 2009 took part in the sixth series of "The X Factor".","title":"Stacey McClean"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Blind Guardian is a German power metal band formed in the mid-1980s in Krefeld, West Germany.","title":"Blind Guardian"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" They are often credited as one of the seminal and most influential bands in the power metal and speed metal subgenres.","title":"Blind Guardian"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" Ten musicians have been a part of the band's line-up in its history, which has consisted of singer Hansi Kürsch, guitarists André Olbrich and Marcus Siepen, and drummer Frederik Ehmke since 2005.","title":"Blind Guardian"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Imaginations from the Other Side is the fifth studio album by Blind Guardian that was released in 1995.","title":"Imaginations from the Other Side"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" The atmosphere of this album is darker in comparison to their earlier works, such as "Battalions of Fear", which had a relatively light tone.","title":"Imaginations from the Other Side"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" This album also marks the first since "Battalions of Fear" in which Kai Hansen (Gamma Ray) did not guest on vocals or guitar, and the last album to feature vocalist Hansi Kürsch as bassist.","title":"Imaginations from the Other Side"},{"sentence_id":3,"text":" It was also their first album to spawn off any singles, in form of "A Past and Future Secret" and "Bright Eyes".","title":"Imaginations from the Other Side"},{"sentence_id":4,"text":" It was remastered and re-released on 15 June 2007, with bonus tracks and videos.","title":"Imaginations from the Other Side"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"André Olbrich (born 3 May 1967, in Düsseldorf, Germany) is a German guitarist, composer and backing vocalist, most known as the co-founder and lead guitarist of power metal band Blind Guardian, in which he serves as one of the main composers with other co-founder Hansi Kürsch.","title":"André Olbrich"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Jon Ryan Schaffer (born March 15, 1968) is an American heavy metal musician.","title":"Jon Schaffer"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" He is best known as the guitarist and last remaining original member of the Florida-based heavy metal band Iced Earth, which he formed in 1985 under the name "Purgatory".","title":"Jon Schaffer"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" He also sings in his side project Sons of Liberty and played guitar for Demons and Wizards, his collaboration with Blind Guardian frontman Hansi Kürsch.","title":"Jon Schaffer"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Hans Jürgen Kürsch, better known as Hansi Kürsch (born 10 August 1966 in Lank-Latum/Meerbusch, Germany), is a German musician best known for being the co-founder, lead vocalist, co-composer, and lyricist of power metal band Blind Guardian.","title":"Hansi Kürsch"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" He was also the bassist in Blind Guardian until the 1998 album "Nightfall in Middle-Earth".","title":"Hansi Kürsch"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" He also provides lead vocals for the band Demons and Wizards.","title":"Hansi Kürsch"}],"peer_messages":["Unverified peer answer: Hansi Kürsch
